{"id":"trato","lemma":"trato","pos":"noun","rank":455,"glosses":["treatment (the process or manner of treating someone or something)","deal, bargain, agreement","behaviour"],"ipa":"/ˈtɾato/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tratos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c9/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-trato.wav","examples":[{"text":"Yo hice un trato.","en":"I made a deal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440332"},{"text":"No tengas tratos con él. No se puede confiar en él para nada.","en":"Don't have anything to do with him. He is completely untrustworthy.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/306472"},{"text":"Es un buen trato.","en":"It's a good deal.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442652"},{"text":"Trato de mantenerme informado.","en":"I try to stay informed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/458816"},{"text":"No trato de hacerlo.","en":"I don't intend to do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/630049"}]}